========AMMO AND ROCKET LORE========
krep:ammo.lore.5_56=§fStandard NATO round for assault rifles. \nHigh muzzle velocity and controlled recoil. \nBalance between accuracy and fire rate.
krep:ammo.lore.9mm=§fThe most common pistol caliber in the world. \nCompact, stable, and predictable in combat. \nIdeal for close range.
krep:ammo.lore.45acp=§fPowerful large-caliber pistol round. \nACP — Automatic Colt Pistol. \nHigh stopping power and heavy bullet.
krep:ammo.lore.12g=§fPowerful shotgun shell. \nMaximum stopping power at short range. \nLeaves no room for error.
krep:ammo.lore.338lapua=§fLong-range sniper caliber. \nExtreme penetration and flight stability. \nDesigned for precise shots over kilometers.
krep:ammo.lore.308win=§fClassic rifle caliber. \nHigh accuracy and versatile application. \nSuitable for medium and long ranges.
krep:ammo.lore.4630mm=§fModern small-caliber round. \nHigh velocity and low recoil. \nEffective against light armor.
krep:ammo.lore.m43=§fClassic intermediate cartridge. \nHigh reliability and power. \nProven by decades of combat use.
krep:ammo.lore.5728mm=§fLight high-velocity round. \nAP — Armor Piercing. \nDesigned to penetrate personal protective equipment.
krep:ammo.lore.5842mm=§fStandard Asian-produced Asian manufacture. \nCombines accuracy and moderate recoil. \nOptimal for automatic fire.
krep:ammo.lore.50ae=§fOne of the most powerful pistol cartridges. \nAE – Action Express. \nCreated for maximum force.
krep:ammo.lore.357mag=§fPowerful revolver cartridge. \nHigh bullet velocity and strong recoil. \nCompact but dangerous.
krep:rocket.lore.rpgrocket=§fHigh-explosive anti-tank RPG-7 charge \nExplodes and leaves a trail behind \n§4DO NOT SHOOT AT PEOPLE AND ANIMALS!

